---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const features=[
 ['✳','Guilds','A place for your people. Build something together, then make it yours.','docs/guilds.html','01'],
 ['↗','Economy','One shared world of currency, rewards and things worth working towards.','docs/economy.html','02'],
 ['≈','Fishing','Quietly become the person who knows far too much about fish.','docs/fishing.html','03'],
 ['♫','Music','Give the voice channel a soundtrack.','docs/music.html','04'],
 ['✣','Text games','Small competitions, collections and friendly distractions.','docs/owo.html','05'],
 ['⌘','Commands','The practical stuff, without the treasure hunt.','docs/commands.html','06']
];
---
<SiteLayout title="NightGuildBot — Stay a little longer" description="A community Discord bot for guilds, progression, fishing, music and the moments between.">
<section class="container hero">
 <div class="hero-copy">
  <div class="hero-kicker"><span class="live-pip"></span> ANOTHER NIGHT IN THE SERVER</div>
  <p class="hero-index">INDEPENDENTLY BUILT / FOR THE PEOPLE IN YOUR CHAT</p>
  <h1>Not just a bot.<br/><em>A reason to <span class="gradient">hang around.</span></em></h1>
  <p class="lead">The conversation slows down. Someone starts a guild. Someone else goes fishing for one last catch. NightGuild gives your community little worlds to get lost in, without getting in the way of the one you already have.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="docs/getting-started.html">Find your way in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="docs/index.html">Explore the field guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  <div class="hero-footnote"><span>BUILT INDEPENDENTLY</span><span class="footnote-line"></span><span>ALWAYS A WORK IN PROGRESS</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="NightGuildBot illustrated activity panel">
  <div class="orbit orbit-a"></div><div class="orbit orbit-b"></div><span class="orbit-star star-a">✳</span><span class="orbit-star star-b">✦</span>
  <div class="hero-float float-top"><span class="float-dot"></span> THE SERVER IS AWAKE</div>
  <div class="hero-panel">
   <div class="panel-heading"><span>NIGHTGUILD / FIELD NOTES</span><span>№ 001</span></div>
   <div class="panel-art"><div class="art-halo"></div><img class="hero-emblem" src="/assets/nightguildbot-logo.webp" alt="NightGuildBot emblem"/><span class="art-orbit-label">NG—V2</span></div>
   <div class="panel-title"><span>TONIGHT'S PLANS</span><span class="panel-date">NO. ONE IS NEVER THE PLAN</span></div>
   <div class="activity-list">
    <div><span class="activity-icon">✳</span><span><b>Find your guild</b><small>Make a little corner of your own</small></span><span class="activity-arrow">↗</span></div>
    <div><span class="activity-icon">≈</span><span><b>Cast one more line</b><small>The Fishdex won't fill itself</small></span><span class="activity-arrow">↗</span></div>
    <div><span class="activity-icon">♫</span><span><b>Set the mood</b><small>Every good night needs a soundtrack</small></span><span class="activity-arrow">↗</span></div>
   </div>
   <div class="panel-bottom"><span><i></i> MADE FOR THE IN-BETWEEN</span><span>STAY A WHILE</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-float float-bottom">ONE MORE ROUND? <span>↗</span></div>
 </div>
</section>
<div class="ticker" aria-label="NightGuildBot features"><div class="ticker-track"><span>MAKE A GUILD</span><i>✳</i><span>FIND SOMETHING RARE</span><i>✳</i><span>LOSE TRACK OF TIME</span><i>✳</i><span>ONE MORE ROUND</span><i>✳</i><span>MAKE A GUILD</span><i>✳</i><span>FIND SOMETHING RARE</span><i>✳</i><span>LOSE TRACK OF TIME</span><i>✳</i><span>ONE MORE ROUND</span><i>✳</i></div></div>
<section class="section feature-section"><div class="container">
 <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO GET INTO</span><h2>Pick up a side quest.<br/><em>Or six.</em></h2></div><p>Useful when you need them. Fun when you don't. NightGuild is a collection of systems that give a server a little more life.</p></div>
 <div class="feature-grid">{features.map(([icon,title,desc,href,num])=><a class="feature-card" href={href}><div class="feature-card-top"><span class="feature-icon">{icon}</span><span class="feature-number">{num} / 06</span></div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div>
</div></section>
<section class="interlude-section"><div class="container interlude">
 <div class="interlude-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>✳</span><span>✦</span><span>✳</span></div>
 <div class="interlude-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE BIT BETWEEN MESSAGES</span><h2>Made for the moments<br/>that aren't announcements.</h2><p>Not every good server moment needs an event, a ping or a plan. Sometimes it's a ridiculous catch, a guild mate showing off an upgrade, or a song that keeps the call going.</p></div>
 <div class="interlude-aside"><span class="aside-number">02:17</span><span class="aside-rule"></span><span class="aside-caption">STILL HERE.<br/>STILL PLAYING.</span></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section closing-section"><div class="container callout-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">NO CEREMONY REQUIRED</span><h2>Come see what’s here.</h2><p>The field guide has the basics. The rest is better discovered in your server.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="docs/index.html">Open the field guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="callout-stamp" aria-hidden="true">NIGHT<br/>GUILD</span></div></section>
</SiteLayout>